  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">営　業　所　一　覧　表</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="営業所一覧表" table:style-name="FormTable">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col1"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col2"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col3"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col4"/>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="HeadRow">
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p text:style-name="HeaderParagraph">名　称</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p text:style-name="HeaderParagraph">責任者職氏名</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p text:style-name="HeaderParagraph">所　在　地</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p text:style-name="HeaderParagraph">電　話</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="BodyRow">
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"><text:p text:style-name="CellParagraph">（入札等の権限を委任されるもの）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="BodyRow">
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"><text:p text:style-name="CellParagraph">（その他のもの）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="BodyRow">
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="BodyRow">
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="BodyRow">
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="FormCell"/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="NotesHeading">記載要項</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Notes">１． 入札、見積及び契約の締結、契約履行等の権限を支社、支店、営業所等に委任したい場合、一ヶ所に限りその名称等を「入札等の権限を委任されるもの」の欄に記載してください。</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Notes">２． 「入札等の権限を委任されるもの」の欄に記載した場合必ず委任状及び使用印鑑届を提出してください。</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Notes">３． 「入札等の権限を委任されるもの」以外に県内に支社、営業所等がある場合「その他のもの」の欄に記入してください。</text:p>
    </office:text>
  </office:body>
